(883310, 101286, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photograph!  What keeps it from being *great*, for me, is the clutter/color saturation.  There is just too much red in the photo to allow the apple (and arm) to stand out enough to really focus the viewer, in my opinion.  I would try a little desaturation of the forest floor and leaves, to help your subject stand out.</td>', 'This is a very good photograph!  What keeps it from being *great*, for me, is the clutter/color saturation.  There is just too much red in the photo to allow the apple (and arm) to stand out enough to really focus the viewer, in my opinion.  I would try a little desaturation of the forest floor and leaves, to help your subject stand out.', '2004-08-30 02:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(883311, 101325, 24805, '<td valign="top">the colors, concept, and composition are great. the black vingete has a bit of a harsh transitoin and the background image feels a bit 2D. can''t go wrong with elf ears though ;o)</td>', 'the colors, concept, and composition are great. the black vingete has a bit of a harsh transitoin and the background image feels a bit 2D. can''t go wrong with elf ears though ;o)', '2004-08-30 02:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
