(883336, 100684, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cute shot, but the burning and dodging is kind of extreme. You can achieve that effect better by burning and dodging the original photo and then softening the entire background at once, instead of doing it in reverse order. Nice separation of FG and BG.</td>', 'Very cute shot, but the burning and dodging is kind of extreme. You can achieve that effect better by burning and dodging the original photo and then softening the entire background at once, instead of doing it in reverse order. Nice separation of FG and BG.', '2004-08-30 02:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
