(883491, 100858, 7252, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept. Others seem to be knocking the use of dolls and figurines but this works. Would be a little better if the environment was darker, more of a night feeling. Perhaps depress the troll into the ground a little more so you don''t see the solid part under the toes. Is that a candle or LED? Perhaps starting a small fire with some of the dead leaves would have given it some more realism. Another thought, perhaps some smoke in the background to simulate fog. I think it would add atmosphere.</td>', 'Very cool concept. Others seem to be knocking the use of dolls and figurines but this works. Would be a little better if the environment was darker, more of a night feeling. Perhaps depress the troll into the ground a little more so you don''t see the solid part under the toes. Is that a candle or LED? Perhaps starting a small fire with some of the dead leaves would have given it some more realism. Another thought, perhaps some smoke in the background to simulate fog. I think it would add atmosphere.', '2004-08-30 04:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
