(883742, 101267, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative use of motion blur - I think the effect works well in this image.</td>', 'Creative use of motion blur - I think the effect works well in this image.', '2004-08-30 10:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(883744, 101372, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great job on the lighting, and a clean background.  I am not crazy about the amount of empty space in this image; The aesthetic balance seems off.</td>', 'Great job on the lighting, and a clean background.  I am not crazy about the amount of empty space in this image; The aesthetic balance seems off.', '2004-08-30 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(883745, 100989, 25065, '<td valign="top">A very pretty lass, indeed.</td>', 'A very pretty lass, indeed.', '2004-08-30 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(883748, 100882, 20204, '<td valign="top">One common suggestion in composition is to never have objects leading your eye out of the photo.  In this case the background flag is a significant subject, yet its partial presence in the frame becomes distracting.  Similarly, the red/yellow corner of the tent to the knight''s side makes us wonder where the rest of it is rather then focusing on the more intricate details of the knight''s armor.  I certainly don''t suggest blindly following rules in photography, but in this case I believe they would help you to compose a stronger image.</td>', 'One common suggestion in composition is to never have objects leading your eye out of the photo.  In this case the background flag is a significant subject, yet its partial presence in the frame becomes distracting.  Similarly, the red/yellow corner of the tent to the knight''s side makes us wonder where the rest of it is rather then focusing on the more intricate details of the knight''s armor.  I certainly don''t suggest blindly following rules in photography, but in this case I believe they would help you to compose a stronger image.', '2004-08-30 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(883750, 100207, 25065, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic!</td>', 'Very cool pic!', '2004-08-30 10:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(883751, 101412, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection work.  The image feels a bit underexposed overall, yet overexposed severely on the swan''s side to the point of loosing detail.</td>', 'Nice reflection work.  The image feels a bit underexposed overall, yet overexposed severely on the swan''s side to the point of loosing detail.', '2004-08-30 10:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(883755, 100855, 20204, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to tell if you were going for soft focus, or if the image is just out of focus.  It feels like the latter.  I like the composition and feel.  Also seems like the lighting might be a touch too strong, but well placed.</td>', 'It''s difficult to tell if you were going for soft focus, or if the image is just out of focus.  It feels like the latter.  I like the composition and feel.  Also seems like the lighting might be a touch too strong, but well placed.', '2004-08-30 10:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(883756, 100694, 20204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful framing and expression, great "fantasy" feel with the softening of the details in the frame''s right side.  Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful framing and expression, great "fantasy" feel with the softening of the details in the frame''s right side.  Very well done.', '2004-08-30 10:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(883757, 101308, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like the camera needs some guide lines in the viewer.  the tilt of this image is crying out to be corrected in editing software.  The image itself is also unsharp.</td>', 'Looks like the camera needs some guide lines in the viewer.  the tilt of this image is crying out to be corrected in editing software.  The image itself is also unsharp.', '2004-08-30 10:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(883758, 101169, 25065, '<td valign="top">I''m just glad there''s an actual bird in his hands... Funny pic.</td>', 'I''m just glad there''s an actual bird in his hands... Funny pic.', '2004-08-30 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(883759, 101396, 25065, '<td valign="top">Heh, another good Beanstalk joke, with my favorite hard beverage!</td>', 'Heh, another good Beanstalk joke, with my favorite hard beverage!', '2004-08-30 10:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(883760, 100997, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great effect, although I think the blue would work better for me if it were a bit more understated.  Very well done image, and one of the best I''ve seen thus far in terms of my expectations of the challenge.</td>', 'Great effect, although I think the blue would work better for me if it were a bit more understated.  Very well done image, and one of the best I''ve seen thus far in terms of my expectations of the challenge.', '2004-08-30 10:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(883761, 100990, 20204, '<td valign="top">Interesting star effects from the steel, but the image has an overall lack of sharpness that bothers me.  I think a touch less blade showing would have focused more attention on the interesting grip and balanced the frame more evenly.</td>', 'Interesting star effects from the steel, but the image has an overall lack of sharpness that bothers me.  I think a touch less blade showing would have focused more attention on the interesting grip and balanced the frame more evenly.', '2004-08-30 10:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(883762, 101279, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the fairly tale aspect, but it''s an interesting image.</td>', 'I''m missing the fairly tale aspect, but it''s an interesting image.', '2004-08-30 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(883763, 101002, 20204, '<td valign="top">Too many distracting images coming from the left.</td>', 'Too many distracting images coming from the left.', '2004-08-30 10:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(883768, 101392, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the selective desaturation in this image, and the overexposure works perfectly in creating the surreal aura.  Well done!</td>', 'I love the selective desaturation in this image, and the overexposure works perfectly in creating the surreal aura.  Well done!', '2004-08-30 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(883769, 100882, 25065, '<td valign="top">He looks ready to go medieval on someone! Great pic!</td>', 'He looks ready to go medieval on someone! Great pic!', '2004-08-30 10:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(883770, 100165, 20204, '<td valign="top">Badly out of focus, and difficult to understand your choice of composition - so much empty space, and poor visualization of your subject by aligning the candles so perpendicular to the sensor plane.</td>', 'Badly out of focus, and difficult to understand your choice of composition - so much empty space, and poor visualization of your subject by aligning the candles so perpendicular to the sensor plane.', '2004-08-30 10:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(883773, 101410, 25065, '<td valign="top">Very good! You managed to get a crown on a real frog! That must''ve been tough!</td>', 'Very good! You managed to get a crown on a real frog! That must''ve been tough!', '2004-08-30 10:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(883774, 100873, 20204, '<td valign="top">the overexposure in the background is a bit extreme...  Distracts from the subjects of the ribbon and the tortoise shell.</td>', 'the overexposure in the background is a bit extreme...  Distracts from the subjects of the ribbon and the tortoise shell.', '2004-08-30 10:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(883779, 101293, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering how far this will go due to its heavy digital art feel.  I''m more of a purist in that I enjoy photographs whcih depict things in a realistic manner.  That being said, I think this is an attractive work.  In the strictest sense, photography means painting with light, so in my mind this is definitely legitimate work, but too overprocessed for my personal tastes.  That being said I''m giving it a relatively high rating,..  You''ve created controversy for me, and I like images that make me think.</td>', 'I''m wondering how far this will go due to its heavy digital art feel.  I''m more of a purist in that I enjoy photographs whcih depict things in a realistic manner.  That being said, I think this is an attractive work.  In the strictest sense, photography means painting with light, so in my mind this is definitely legitimate work, but too overprocessed for my personal tastes.  That being said I''m giving it a relatively high rating,..  You''ve created controversy for me, and I like images that make me think.', '2004-08-30 10:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(883782, 100428, 20204, '<td valign="top">Looks like quite a bit of focus problems in the image, and overexposure on the foreground branch - looks like from flash.</td>', 'Looks like quite a bit of focus problems in the image, and overexposure on the foreground branch - looks like from flash.', '2004-08-30 10:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(883784, 100699, 20204, '<td valign="top">Very clever arrangement.  Great work!</td>', 'Very clever arrangement.  Great work!', '2004-08-30 10:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(883789, 101269, 13136, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see some humor. Good idea, well done.</td>', 'I''m glad to see some humor. Good idea, well done.', '2004-08-30 10:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(883792, 101396, 13136, '<td valign="top">Glad to see the humor. Good idea, well executed.</td>', 'Glad to see the humor. Good idea, well executed.', '2004-08-30 10:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(883796, 101353, 13136, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, good location. Too bad you couldn''t get the DOF so as to bring the nearby plants in better focus.</td>', 'Neat idea, good location. Too bad you couldn''t get the DOF so as to bring the nearby plants in better focus.', '2004-08-30 10:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(883798, 100542, 20204, '<td valign="top">Beutiful image, but it feels like stretching the theme a bit.  I''d suggest a bit less sky in this with more foreground to replace it.  This would better lead your eye to the subject and remove some distraction.</td>', 'Beutiful image, but it feels like stretching the theme a bit.  I''d suggest a bit less sky in this with more foreground to replace it.  This would better lead your eye to the subject and remove some distraction.', '2004-08-30 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(883800, 100207, 318, '<td valign="top">Very clever, love the makeup.</td>', 'Very clever, love the makeup.', '2004-08-30 10:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(883809, 101313, 318, '<td valign="top">Glymur klikkar ekki. :)</td>', 'Glymur klikkar ekki. :)', '2004-08-30 11:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
