(883857, 101287, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very striking, great pose, beautifully lit and pin sharp.</td>', 'Very striking, great pose, beautifully lit and pin sharp.', '2004-08-30 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(883858, 101325, 8643, '<td valign="top">Neatly done, lovely model, just right.</td>', 'Neatly done, lovely model, just right.', '2004-08-30 11:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(883874, 101286, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant autumn colors of this shot, they stand out very nicely. I also like that the character is suggested rather than full blown in the shot. There is enough to make it obvious who/what it represents and yet doesnt destroy any preconceived notion of what the character looks like. (if that makes sense). The composition is good, lighting is good, the placement of all the elements excellent. This is my fav of the challenge.</td>', 'I love the vibrant autumn colors of this shot, they stand out very nicely. I also like that the character is suggested rather than full blown in the shot. There is enough to make it obvious who/what it represents and yet doesnt destroy any preconceived notion of what the character looks like. (if that makes sense). The composition is good, lighting is good, the placement of all the elements excellent. This is my fav of the challenge.', '2004-08-30 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(883878, 100686, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has a great mood and I love the toning. Just great, one of my favs in the challenge.</td>', 'This has a great mood and I love the toning. Just great, one of my favs in the challenge.', '2004-08-30 12:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(883880, 100694, 6008, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait! The colors, sharpness, and composition are all great. I like the subtle use of a prop to add to the fairy tale theme and the interesting ''attitude'' on her face. One of my top three!</td>', 'Excellent portrait! The colors, sharpness, and composition are all great. I like the subtle use of a prop to add to the fairy tale theme and the interesting ''attitude'' on her face. One of my top three!', '2004-08-30 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(883882, 101296, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and the use of DOF, composition is good too.</td>', 'I like the tones and the use of DOF, composition is good too.', '2004-08-30 12:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(883884, 101410, 6008, '<td valign="top">The best of the frog shots by far. Great clarity, good composition, and it looks like  quite a natural scene.</td>', 'The best of the frog shots by far. Great clarity, good composition, and it looks like  quite a natural scene.', '2004-08-30 12:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(883895, 100207, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great image!</td>', 'Great image!', '2004-08-30 12:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(883901, 100165, 10686, '<td valign="top">too much nothing going on.</td>', 'too much nothing going on.', '2004-08-30 12:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(883903, 101293, 10686, '<td valign="top">Love the dreamy quality. 9</td>', 'Love the dreamy quality. 9', '2004-08-30 12:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(883908, 100576, 10686, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I just think the hat is a bit too bright</td>', 'Neat shot, I just think the hat is a bit too bright', '2004-08-30 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(883912, 101384, 10686, '<td valign="top">Cute. This is one where the sel. desat actually works well. Good job! (IMO, it''s overused and overrated) - 9</td>', 'Cute. This is one where the sel. desat actually works well. Good job! (IMO, it''s overused and overrated) - 9', '2004-08-30 12:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(883913, 100810, 23312, '<td valign="top">Clever idea - I think that more light on some of the foreground cards, especially the bigger ones, would help it a bit.</td>', 'Clever idea - I think that more light on some of the foreground cards, especially the bigger ones, would help it a bit.', '2004-08-30 12:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(883920, 100207, 24715, '<td valign="top">10. What else is there to say? :-)</td>', '10. What else is there to say? :-)', '2004-08-30 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(883922, 101380, 19425, '<td valign="top">Looks like candy money. Plus its hard to tell its even under a pillow. I like the idea, but would have liked it better with some real money and a better composition</td>', 'Looks like candy money. Plus its hard to tell its even under a pillow. I like the idea, but would have liked it better with some real money and a better composition', '2004-08-30 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(883923, 101410, 24715, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, contrast and focus. Great job!</td>', 'Good lighting, contrast and focus. Great job!', '2004-08-30 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(883931, 101325, 24715, '<td valign="top">It definitely gives a magic feel. Color, contrast and the soft blur are great! One of the best in this challenge!</td>', 'It definitely gives a magic feel. Color, contrast and the soft blur are great! One of the best in this challenge!', '2004-08-30 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(883932, 100997, 19425, '<td valign="top">Merlin? Looks like a cross between "little red riding hood" and "death". Either way, its a pretty cool shot. Alittle over processed, but still cool</td>', 'Merlin? Looks like a cross between "little red riding hood" and "death". Either way, its a pretty cool shot. Alittle over processed, but still cool', '2004-08-30 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(883939, 101296, 19425, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had difficulty finding a glass slipper also :)</td>', 'Looks like you had difficulty finding a glass slipper also :)', '2004-08-30 12:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(883944, 100996, 19425, '<td valign="top">wow, awesome pic. love that you put some effort into it. the only nit picky thing to say is that for a mean old witch, she sure does have a nice manicure. :)</td>', 'wow, awesome pic. love that you put some effort into it. the only nit picky thing to say is that for a mean old witch, she sure does have a nice manicure. :)', '2004-08-30 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(883950, 100997, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the colors are very mystical and enchanting...good job</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the colors are very mystical and enchanting...good job', '2004-08-30 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(883953, 101323, 10848, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture, wonderful clarity and detail.</td>', 'Outstanding capture, wonderful clarity and detail.', '2004-08-30 12:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(883955, 100706, 19425, '<td valign="top">sorry, but its just a book. Although the addition of a long nose is unique</td>', 'sorry, but its just a book. Although the addition of a long nose is unique', '2004-08-30 12:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
