(883978, 100872, 23956, '<td valign="top">This would be a better image if santa''s eyes were both clearly visible. As my mother told me constantly in Junior High, "get your hair out of your eyes, I can''t see you!" Otherwise, good tones. I like the slight green of the walls. to contrast with the red hat.</td>', 'This would be a better image if santa''s eyes were both clearly visible. As my mother told me constantly in Junior High, "get your hair out of your eyes, I can''t see you!" Otherwise, good tones. I like the slight green of the walls. to contrast with the red hat.', '2004-08-30 13:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
