(884439, 101325, 21034, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, but there''s an awful lot of repetition on the left side of the image.  Also, the transistion between dark and light is awfully abrupt.</td>', 'The colors are great, but there''s an awful lot of repetition on the left side of the image.  Also, the transistion between dark and light is awfully abrupt.', '2004-08-30 18:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(884441, 101288, 21034, '<td valign="top">Without the title, this one doesn''t seem to fit very well. But it''s a wonderful image.</td>', 'Without the title, this one doesn''t seem to fit very well. But it''s a wonderful image.', '2004-08-30 18:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(884448, 100691, 3087, '<td valign="top">My joint favourite in this challenge. I love the creativity behind this - taking a toy that comes from our rich library fairy tales and then adding something so simple as a sparkler to make it come alive. Simple in thought and brilliant in execution, nice composition, nice vibrancy!</td>', 'My joint favourite in this challenge. I love the creativity behind this - taking a toy that comes from our rich library fairy tales and then adding something so simple as a sparkler to make it come alive. Simple in thought and brilliant in execution, nice composition, nice vibrancy!', '2004-08-30 18:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(884450, 101296, 3087, '<td valign="top">I have two favourites in this challenge, this is one of them. I like the use of shallow DOF to throw the detail of that castle out - less obvious that it''s not real. I like the chosen prop - a modern day style but with that touch of glamourous glitter. Composition works for me. And how creative to see this kind of subject approached succesfully in black and white - the general assumption seems to be that fairy tale = colour. Excellent!</td>', 'I have two favourites in this challenge, this is one of them. I like the use of shallow DOF to throw the detail of that castle out - less obvious that it''s not real. I like the chosen prop - a modern day style but with that touch of glamourous glitter. Composition works for me. And how creative to see this kind of subject approached succesfully in black and white - the general assumption seems to be that fairy tale = colour. Excellent!', '2004-08-30 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(884574, 101267, 25150, '<td valign="top">excellent use of movement. did you use a density filter to slow your exposure? or did you shoot at dusk? Very nice capture, and a excellent idea</td>', 'excellent use of movement. did you use a density filter to slow your exposure? or did you shoot at dusk? Very nice capture, and a excellent idea', '2004-08-30 21:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(884579, 100542, 23312, '<td valign="top">This looks like Old Faithful to me so I get a little confused by the title.</td>', 'This looks like Old Faithful to me so I get a little confused by the title.', '2004-08-30 21:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(884582, 101347, 23956, '<td valign="top">Great aperture control!</td>', 'Great aperture control!', '2004-08-30 21:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(884584, 100989, 23312, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait - I think having her leaning on a mop handle or something would have made it seem more day-dreamy and Cinderella-like.</td>', 'This is a nice portrait - I think having her leaning on a mop handle or something would have made it seem more day-dreamy and Cinderella-like.', '2004-08-30 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(884586, 100856, 164, '<td valign="top">Love the look on his face</td>', 'Love the look on his face', '2004-08-30 21:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(884587, 101279, 23312, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to get Goldilocks - but that makes the title that much more funny (or should I say punny?).  I think whatever effect you used is right on the edge of being too much but overall I like this shot - very clever and original.</td>', 'Took me a while to get Goldilocks - but that makes the title that much more funny (or should I say punny?).  I think whatever effect you used is right on the edge of being too much but overall I like this shot - very clever and original.', '2004-08-30 21:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
