(884670, 101410, 24967, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!  I can''t believe you got that frog to keep that crown on.  Too funny and fit the bill for the cfhallenge!  Well Done!</td>', 'Great Shot!  I can''t believe you got that frog to keep that crown on.  Too funny and fit the bill for the cfhallenge!  Well Done!', '2004-08-30 22:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(884673, 101048, 19982, '<td valign="top">I like the angles in the photo created by the face, the arm and the hand.   Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the angles in the photo created by the face, the arm and the hand.   Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-08-30 22:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(884678, 100859, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and good color.  Might have been nicer still with a little less confusion in the background.</td>', 'Nice depth of field and good color.  Might have been nicer still with a little less confusion in the background.', '2004-08-30 22:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(884683, 100884, 24967, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh...great idea and great shot.</td>', 'Made me laugh...great idea and great shot.', '2004-08-30 22:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(884692, 101329, 24967, '<td valign="top">I you were able to stay within the limits of editing then Well Done...I''d also love to know how you did it :-)</td>', 'I you were able to stay within the limits of editing then Well Done...I''d also love to know how you did it :-)', '2004-08-30 22:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(884695, 101395, 19982, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if the focus on the plant instead of the person is a mistake or on purpose.   So either I am misunderstanding the title (in thinking the person is the fairy, in which case it should be the person that is in focus), or I''m blind and don''t see the fairy in the plant.</td>', 'I can''t tell if the focus on the plant instead of the person is a mistake or on purpose.   So either I am misunderstanding the title (in thinking the person is the fairy, in which case it should be the person that is in focus), or I''m blind and don''t see the fairy in the plant.', '2004-08-30 22:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(884696, 100503, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the effect; however I thought this lacked a focal point.</td>', 'I like the colors and the effect; however I thought this lacked a focal point.', '2004-08-30 22:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(884702, 100389, 19982, '<td valign="top">A good idea.  I think a little softer lighting would have helped a lot.  You might also want to try desaturating the greens in photoshop so that the goose and the egg get more of the attention instead of the grass.</td>', 'A good idea.  I think a little softer lighting would have helped a lot.  You might also want to try desaturating the greens in photoshop so that the goose and the egg get more of the attention instead of the grass.', '2004-08-30 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(884707, 100207, 24967, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!  This is one of my favorites, I hope to see you in one of the top 3!</td>', 'Great Shot!  This is one of my favorites, I hope to see you in one of the top 3!', '2004-08-30 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(884713, 100855, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.  I love the colors, the depth of field, the softness in the subject and the exposure.  You''re going to have to tell us when the challenge is over just what "Veinixienzia Ox" really means!</td>', 'Lovely photo.  I love the colors, the depth of field, the softness in the subject and the exposure.  You''re going to have to tell us when the challenge is over just what "Veinixienzia Ox" really means!', '2004-08-30 22:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(884717, 100207, 25464, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very nice.  Great effort.  I find the pose a little distracting because no pupil is visible in the other eye.  I would have liked to see a full profile, or turned a little more to the camera.  I also would have edited the white part of the eye to remove the redness.  My attention seems to go there first. 7.</td>', 'I thought this was very nice.  Great effort.  I find the pose a little distracting because no pupil is visible in the other eye.  I would have liked to see a full profile, or turned a little more to the camera.  I also would have edited the white part of the eye to remove the redness.  My attention seems to go there first. 7.', '2004-08-30 22:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(884718, 100884, 19982, '<td valign="top">I hope this guy''s a fairy tale ... otherwise he''d make the rest of us look bad!  Love the selective desaturation.  Great idea.  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'I hope this guy''s a fairy tale ... otherwise he''d make the rest of us look bad!  Love the selective desaturation.  Great idea.  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-08-30 22:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(884722, 101400, 19982, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful in its simplicity.  Great idea!  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'It''s beautiful in its simplicity.  Great idea!  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-08-30 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(884724, 101325, 24967, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done!  Only one of two I have seen so far I am sure will be in the top 3</td>', 'Extremely well done!  Only one of two I have seen so far I am sure will be in the top 3', '2004-08-30 23:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(884726, 101403, 19982, '<td valign="top">A modern day little red riding hood...  great idea!  Good luck on the challenge.</td>', 'A modern day little red riding hood...  great idea!  Good luck on the challenge.', '2004-08-30 23:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
