(884733, 100428, 19982, '<td valign="top">What is it?  If this is for real, when the challenge is over you really must let us know.  Great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What is it?  If this is for real, when the challenge is over you really must let us know.  Great photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-08-30 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
