(884833, 101411, 2792, '<td valign="top">Aweseome pic, love the smoke.  It looks like the crystal ball is glowing!  Was this taken at the Minnesota Renfest; i''ve seen this guy before....</td>', 'Aweseome pic, love the smoke.  It looks like the crystal ball is glowing!  Was this taken at the Minnesota Renfest; i''ve seen this guy before....', '2004-08-31 00:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
