(884842, 100989, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is so perfect.  The expression on the models face is perfect &amp; very effective.  Great shot!  SHe''s beautiful.</td>', 'This is so perfect.  The expression on the models face is perfect & very effective.  Great shot!  SHe''s beautiful.', '2004-08-31 00:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
