(885091, 100884, 10170, '<td valign="top">Too hillarious for words.  In photographic terms it is just stunning.  Lighting is great, model looks very at ease (has to make you wonder about him ;) the amount of sharpness/blur is supberb, and I love the use of desaturation.  Simply stunning, has to be a ribbon here and can''t wait to see who did this.  10+</td>', 'Too hillarious for words.  In photographic terms it is just stunning.  Lighting is great, model looks very at ease (has to make you wonder about him ;) the amount of sharpness/blur is supberb, and I love the use of desaturation.  Simply stunning, has to be a ribbon here and can''t wait to see who did this.  10+', '2004-08-31 07:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(885097, 100576, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love the atmosphere you have created here.  Great choice of a model.</td>', 'Love the atmosphere you have created here.  Great choice of a model.', '2004-08-31 07:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(885098, 101405, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the effect here.  THe lighting really works well.  And the spin/blur in the mirror really makes for a cool effect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the effect here.  THe lighting really works well.  And the spin/blur in the mirror really makes for a cool effect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-08-31 07:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(885099, 101269, 19982, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  :-)</td>', 'Hilarious!  :-)', '2004-08-31 07:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(885100, 101403, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever modern version of this tale, love it.</td>', 'Very clever modern version of this tale, love it.', '2004-08-31 07:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(885105, 100549, 10170, '<td valign="top">Like the composition, use of colour and the grain here.  Nice work.</td>', 'Like the composition, use of colour and the grain here.  Nice work.', '2004-08-31 07:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(885107, 101027, 10170, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see Buddah as a fairy tale in any sense of the word, but maybe that''s a cultural thing.  So, ignoring that ..... this photo is simply stunning.  Love the light, the angle, and even the background.</td>', 'Not sure I see Buddah as a fairy tale in any sense of the word, but maybe that''s a cultural thing.  So, ignoring that ..... this photo is simply stunning.  Love the light, the angle, and even the background.', '2004-08-31 07:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(885109, 100389, 10170, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the egg looks fake as it has been over processed, or if it looks fake as, well, it is fake and added in after the event.  It just doesn''t look like it belongs, sorry.  I think it might be the focus on it is too crisp compared to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Not sure if the egg looks fake as it has been over processed, or if it looks fake as, well, it is fake and added in after the event.  It just doesn''t look like it belongs, sorry.  I think it might be the focus on it is too crisp compared to the rest of the photo.', '2004-08-31 07:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(885112, 101384, 10170, '<td valign="top">Just perfect.  Great composition, model and "wolf".  Nice use of selective desaturation.  This has to be in the top few, hopefully a ribbon.</td>', 'Just perfect.  Great composition, model and "wolf".  Nice use of selective desaturation.  This has to be in the top few, hopefully a ribbon.', '2004-08-31 07:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(885113, 100207, 10170, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the challenge.  Love the lighting and with that cheeky smile she really could be an imp.  If you can be bothered to PM me I would love to know what you used there for the green makup, it is sensational.  What a truly lovely smile, it is captivating.  10</td>', 'My favourite of the challenge.  Love the lighting and with that cheeky smile she really could be an imp.  If you can be bothered to PM me I would love to know what you used there for the green makup, it is sensational.  What a truly lovely smile, it is captivating.  10', '2004-08-31 07:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(885115, 100810, 10170, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you did the cards here, but very well done indeed.</td>', 'I have no idea how you did the cards here, but very well done indeed.', '2004-08-31 07:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(885118, 101206, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done indeed with the powder.  The whole thing then works well as a balanced composition.  Great stuff.</td>', 'Very cleverly done indeed with the powder.  The whole thing then works well as a balanced composition.  Great stuff.', '2004-08-31 07:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
