(885254, 101267, 8296, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.  This was a difficult Challenge topic.   Good concept.</td>', 'Nicely executed.  This was a difficult Challenge topic.   Good concept.', '2004-08-31 11:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
