(885260, 101329, 8296, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.   But how was this done within the rules of the Challenge?  It looks like a digital montage which I assume is not how you did it?</td>', 'Nicely done.   But how was this done within the rules of the Challenge?  It looks like a digital montage which I assume is not how you did it?', '2004-08-31 11:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(885262, 101323, 25143, '<td valign="top">not too fairy tale''ish but a nice reflection</td>', 'not too fairy tale''ish but a nice reflection', '2004-08-31 11:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(885263, 101298, 25143, '<td valign="top">great simple idea and very well done</td>', 'great simple idea and very well done', '2004-08-31 11:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(885264, 101206, 8296, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent!  Nice.</td>', 'Technically excellent!  Nice.', '2004-08-31 11:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(885265, 100686, 6999, '<td valign="top">Now then. I like the shot, in a way - certainly admire the technical achievement of it, at least. But I dislike the posed-ness of it, the fabrication of it. Too much to do with fashion photography, the rule of style over content, a kind of contrived moodiness, and perhaps an over-simplification of, well, everything. It wouldn''t look out of place as a Prince album-cover, I shouldn''t imagine - which is exactly what I think I don''t like about it. Probably an 8 for technique (lacking a true touch of the bizarre, that killer composition). Creatively - a 3.</td>', 'Now then. I like the shot, in a way - certainly admire the technical achievement of it, at least. But I dislike the posed-ness of it, the fabrication of it. Too much to do with fashion photography, the rule of style over content, a kind of contrived moodiness, and perhaps an over-simplification of, well, everything. It wouldn''t look out of place as a Prince album-cover, I shouldn''t imagine - which is exactly what I think I don''t like about it. Probably an 8 for technique (lacking a true touch of the bizarre, that killer composition). Creatively - a 3.', '2004-08-31 11:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(885267, 101411, 25143, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped the bottom - the face etc is interesting enough - would have been nice with a more unfocused background</td>', 'I would have cropped the bottom - the face etc is interesting enough - would have been nice with a more unfocused background', '2004-08-31 11:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(885269, 100870, 25143, '<td valign="top">great idea but I find the colors too dull</td>', 'great idea but I find the colors too dull', '2004-08-31 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(885270, 101030, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much conflict in the focus/unfocus - great weird colors !!</td>', 'too much conflict in the focus/unfocus - great weird colors !!', '2004-08-31 11:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(885271, 101033, 25143, '<td valign="top">great mood and color contrast</td>', 'great mood and color contrast', '2004-08-31 11:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(885272, 101286, 6999, '<td valign="top">Comes across as twee, contrived, sentimental. Of course it''s technically wonderful, compositionally assured, very well lit, etc. etc., but it doesn''t do anything for me as photography. Really competent comission work, but lacking any real imaginative fire. I''m sure it will score well however.</td>', 'Comes across as twee, contrived, sentimental. Of course it''s technically wonderful, compositionally assured, very well lit, etc. etc., but it doesn''t do anything for me as photography. Really competent comission work, but lacking any real imaginative fire. I''m sure it will score well however.', '2004-08-31 11:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(885273, 100869, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much like the typical mall picture - why not give it a black background to juxtapose the mood ?</td>', 'too much like the typical mall picture - why not give it a black background to juxtapose the mood ?', '2004-08-31 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(885275, 100872, 25143, '<td valign="top">too much conflicting mood; the setting, the cigarette, the eyes</td>', 'too much conflicting mood; the setting, the cigarette, the eyes', '2004-08-31 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(885276, 101048, 25143, '<td valign="top">very nicely done !!</td>', 'very nicely done !!', '2004-08-31 11:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(885279, 101380, 6999, '<td valign="top">Dang - must be the evil expansionist/imperial tooth fairy, then. The worldwide conglomerate tooth fairy - not happy with the simple process evolved by the traditional tooth fairy over millennia, resorts to morally dubious means, though remaining within the letter of the written law, to drive an increase in turnover in a business beset by improving dental medication and care. Analysts at Thrust Clench and Grasp, city stockbrokers, expressed their approval.<br/> <br/>Technically, I think your image could perhaps have benefited from a clearer depiction of location - at this closeness, it isn''t really clear what these surfaces are. Control of light could have been better too - the highlights are a touch harsh, and composition is a bit blunt and lacking finesse. But it''s a neat twist, all the same. 7</td>', 'Dang - must be the evil expansionist/imperial tooth fairy, then. The worldwide conglomerate tooth fairy - not happy with the simple process evolved by the traditional tooth fairy over millennia, resorts to morally dubious means, though remaining within the letter of the written law, to drive an increase in turnover in a business beset by improving dental medication and care. Analysts at Thrust Clench and Grasp, city stockbrokers, expressed their approval. Technically, I think your image could perhaps have benefited from a clearer depiction of location - at this closeness, it isn''t really clear what these surfaces are. Control of light could have been better too - the highlights are a touch harsh, and composition is a bit blunt and lacking finesse. But it''s a neat twist, all the same. 7', '2004-08-31 11:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(885280, 100576, 25143, '<td valign="top">great colors and composition</td>', 'great colors and composition', '2004-08-31 11:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
