(887331, 100997, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the border and I''d like to know how much was done in post-processing but regardless of that, this is a fantastic shot.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the border and I''d like to know how much was done in post-processing but regardless of that, this is a fantastic shot.', '2004-09-01 06:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(887332, 100576, 2780, '<td valign="top">A little bit more light on the knife to help distinguish it from the background would help a lot.</td>', 'A little bit more light on the knife to help distinguish it from the background would help a lot.', '2004-09-01 06:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(887333, 100684, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehe nice :) I like the mixture of real and surreal here.</td>', 'Hehe nice :) I like the mixture of real and surreal here.', '2004-09-01 07:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(887335, 100856, 2780, '<td valign="top">A less head on angle would work better here I think, so we could see more of the boy filling up more of the frame.</td>', 'A less head on angle would work better here I think, so we could see more of the boy filling up more of the frame.', '2004-09-01 07:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(887337, 101407, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice idea :) The small bit of black in front of the car is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Nice idea :) The small bit of black in front of the car is a bit distracting though.', '2004-09-01 07:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(887341, 100873, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand how this fits in with the fairy tale theme? Maybe I''ve just never heard this particular fairy tale. I think the background is a bit bright.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand how this fits in with the fairy tale theme? Maybe I''ve just never heard this particular fairy tale. I think the background is a bit bright.', '2004-09-01 07:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(887342, 101269, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit soft. USM in post processing would help.</td>', 'Looks a bit soft. USM in post processing would help.', '2004-09-01 07:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(887344, 101396, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this :) Clever idea and nice vibrant colours.</td>', 'I like this :) Clever idea and nice vibrant colours.', '2004-09-01 07:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(887347, 100542, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a stretch to meet the challenge in my opinion. Boosting the contrast a bit would give the actual photo more impact, and add dramatic effect :)</td>', 'This is a stretch to meet the challenge in my opinion. Boosting the contrast a bit would give the actual photo more impact, and add dramatic effect :)', '2004-09-01 07:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(887352, 101206, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this one! The lighting is very good, and I like the motion blur coming down :)</td>', 'I like this one! The lighting is very good, and I like the motion blur coming down :)', '2004-09-01 07:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(887354, 101384, 2780, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation looks fantastic here, and the high contrast black and white is great too. A definate 10 from me.</td>', 'The selective desaturation looks fantastic here, and the high contrast black and white is great too. A definate 10 from me.', '2004-09-01 07:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(887356, 100882, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think a neutral black or white border would look better on this photo. Actually, putting the whole thing in black and white would look pretty good I think. Did you try cropping in closer on the knight?</td>', 'I think a neutral black or white border would look better on this photo. Actually, putting the whole thing in black and white would look pretty good I think. Did you try cropping in closer on the knight?', '2004-09-01 07:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(887361, 100706, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours seem a bit dull and flat here. I think you may have underexposed as there are no whites in the photo. You can fix this in postprocessing by boosting the contrast or adjusting the levels, or you could reshoot and adjust the exposure time to slightly longer. Also I dont really like the border colour much.</td>', 'The colours seem a bit dull and flat here. I think you may have underexposed as there are no whites in the photo. You can fix this in postprocessing by boosting the contrast or adjusting the levels, or you could reshoot and adjust the exposure time to slightly longer. Also I dont really like the border colour much.', '2004-09-01 07:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(887364, 101329, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred this shot if she wasnt transparent. She just looks a bit fuzzy at the moment.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred this shot if she wasnt transparent. She just looks a bit fuzzy at the moment.', '2004-09-01 07:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(887365, 101380, 2780, '<td valign="top">Wow, I never got chocolate money! Wouldn''t it kinda melt under the pillow? hehe :)</td>', 'Wow, I never got chocolate money! Wouldn''t it kinda melt under the pillow? hehe :)', '2004-09-01 07:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(887373, 101300, 2780, '<td valign="top">Overall I like the shot, but I think the way you have blurred the background to create a false DoF ruins the shot. I don''t like the way the edges of the objects in it are blurred either. If your camera can''t achieve real DoF, you could try taking a photo of the background, putting it into photoshop, then gaussian blur that. Afterwards, display the blurred background on your computer monitor, and place your props in front of it. That way you get a more realistic looking out of focus background without having to worry about using the selection tools and ruining the sharp edges of your props in the final photo.</td>', 'Overall I like the shot, but I think the way you have blurred the background to create a false DoF ruins the shot. I don''t like the way the edges of the objects in it are blurred either. If your camera can''t achieve real DoF, you could try taking a photo of the background, putting it into photoshop, then gaussian blur that. Afterwards, display the blurred background on your computer monitor, and place your props in front of it. That way you get a more realistic looking out of focus background without having to worry about using the selection tools and ruining the sharp edges of your props in the final photo.', '2004-09-01 07:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(887375, 101408, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the soft focus is used too strongly here. A little bit more subtle would have looked better.</td>', 'I think the soft focus is used too strongly here. A little bit more subtle would have looked better.', '2004-09-01 07:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(887377, 101403, 2780, '<td valign="top">A modern adaptation :) I like it! I especially like the wolf wearing a suit, it''s great :)</td>', 'A modern adaptation :) I like it! I especially like the wolf wearing a suit, it''s great :)', '2004-09-01 07:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(887379, 101033, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little bit too bright. The soft focus looks good but it also washes out around the highlights. If you exposed this slightly less I think i would like it more.</td>', 'I think it''s a little bit too bright. The soft focus looks good but it also washes out around the highlights. If you exposed this slightly less I think i would like it more.', '2004-09-01 07:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(887381, 100989, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice emotive portrait.</td>', 'This is a really nice emotive portrait.', '2004-09-01 07:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(887385, 101325, 2780, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame you chose this position for her, because her hait almost gets lost in the shadowy backgorund. If she was a bit more to the left then her hair would be against the green and she would stand out better. I think the soft focus effect was applied a little too strongly too.</td>', 'It''s a shame you chose this position for her, because her hait almost gets lost in the shadowy backgorund. If she was a bit more to the left then her hair would be against the green and she would stand out better. I think the soft focus effect was applied a little too strongly too.', '2004-09-01 07:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(887387, 101048, 2780, '<td valign="top">The photo has a good composition, but it just lacks something for me. I''m not sure what. Also, I don''t really like the title - too long and doesn''t seem right.</td>', 'The photo has a good composition, but it just lacks something for me. I''m not sure what. Also, I don''t really like the title - too long and doesn''t seem right.', '2004-09-01 07:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(887390, 101313, 2780, '<td valign="top">This shot is great, I really like the flares from the blown out areas, and the background is really good for the shot.</td>', 'This shot is great, I really like the flares from the blown out areas, and the background is really good for the shot.', '2004-09-01 07:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(887402, 101042, 2780, '<td valign="top">I dont really have any suggestions to add to this other than it looks slightly soft, so sharpening it a tiny bit might help.</td>', 'I dont really have any suggestions to add to this other than it looks slightly soft, so sharpening it a tiny bit might help.', '2004-09-01 07:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(887405, 100389, 2780, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit out of focus. I think you should sharpen this to improve it.</td>', 'Looks a bit out of focus. I think you should sharpen this to improve it.', '2004-09-01 07:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(887407, 101359, 2780, '<td valign="top">The highlights seem to be a bit too blown out here. Also I think cropping in closer on the toad, maybe getting rig of half the dark area, would improve the shot and composition.</td>', 'The highlights seem to be a bit too blown out here. Also I think cropping in closer on the toad, maybe getting rig of half the dark area, would improve the shot and composition.', '2004-09-01 07:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(887411, 100715, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the white fur is too blown out and too much detail is lost.</td>', 'I think the white fur is too blown out and too much detail is lost.', '2004-09-01 07:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(887415, 101300, 6999, '<td valign="top">The transition in to blur is so very sudden that one has to presume this is edited rather than shot that way - but it is effective, achieving what the shallow dof should do in complicated and distracting background situations. Crop and composition is pretty good, I just find the positioning of those leaves and flower a touch strange - as is the light there, really quite blank. The more I look, the less i think you needed to keep the dead space image left - it seems wasted, rather than influential.</td>', 'The transition in to blur is so very sudden that one has to presume this is edited rather than shot that way - but it is effective, achieving what the shallow dof should do in complicated and distracting background situations. Crop and composition is pretty good, I just find the positioning of those leaves and flower a touch strange - as is the light there, really quite blank. The more I look, the less i think you needed to keep the dead space image left - it seems wasted, rather than influential.', '2004-09-01 07:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(887421, 101289, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really good. I like the lighting and the atmosphere you created.</td>', 'This is really good. I like the lighting and the atmosphere you created.', '2004-09-01 07:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(887432, 100988, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intriguing set-up, for me badly let down by what looks like on-board flash - that very harsh shadow, mass of bright reflections. I think you''ve gone some way with editing to correcting that, but the effect on the figurine remains. Like the halo-effect, but really wish that light could have been softer, less brutally front-on. Having said that, the kind of mock-photojournalist black and white treatment is effective, quite dynamic ... and I guess that flash could be used to help that effect ... but given it''s so obviously set-up, I think my original opinion holds. 6</td>', 'Intriguing set-up, for me badly let down by what looks like on-board flash - that very harsh shadow, mass of bright reflections. I think you''ve gone some way with editing to correcting that, but the effect on the figurine remains. Like the halo-effect, but really wish that light could have been softer, less brutally front-on. Having said that, the kind of mock-photojournalist black and white treatment is effective, quite dynamic ... and I guess that flash could be used to help that effect ... but given it''s so obviously set-up, I think my original opinion holds. 6', '2004-09-01 07:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(887450, 101033, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great idea - not wildly original, but doeasn''t matter at all - and well posed and located. Good composition, too - placement of girl in frame, choice of trees and movement of the path through frame, allowing enough ''forest'' to be a major element. But it lacks mystery, unfortunately - lacks any kind of mystery for me. I cannot believe the wood would have been such a friendly sunny place as this. I think with a lot of selective darkening of certain areas - the ground, mainly, and the vanishing point of the path, that might have been achieved taking this as a base. It cries out for a more ghostly, threatening light. But good work, nonetheless.</td>', 'Great idea - not wildly original, but doeasn''t matter at all - and well posed and located. Good composition, too - placement of girl in frame, choice of trees and movement of the path through frame, allowing enough ''forest'' to be a major element. But it lacks mystery, unfortunately - lacks any kind of mystery for me. I cannot believe the wood would have been such a friendly sunny place as this. I think with a lot of selective darkening of certain areas - the ground, mainly, and the vanishing point of the path, that might have been achieved taking this as a base. It cries out for a more ghostly, threatening light. But good work, nonetheless.', '2004-09-01 08:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(887478, 101296, 6912, '<td valign="top">takes me back to the childhood :-)</td>', 'takes me back to the childhood :-)', '2004-09-01 08:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(887497, 101340, 25742, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2004-09-01 08:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(887538, 101325, 15204, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge!  I love the lighting and the colors.  The soft focus on the model is awesome, and really gives it that fairy tale feeling.  I honestly can''t think of a suggestion to improve it. - 10</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge!  I love the lighting and the colors.  The soft focus on the model is awesome, and really gives it that fairy tale feeling.  I honestly can''t think of a suggestion to improve it. - 10', '2004-09-01 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(887540, 100207, 15204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and makeup!  I like the model''s expression and how it is highlighted by the tight crop.  Excellent.</td>', 'Great lighting and makeup!  I like the model''s expression and how it is highlighted by the tight crop.  Excellent.', '2004-09-01 09:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(887543, 101347, 15204, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.  I like how it makes the blurred grass (foreground and background)look around the sharp apple.  It also makes the model''s lips stand out of the backgorund, which adds to the "eating the poisonous apple" idea.</td>', 'Great DOF.  I like how it makes the blurred grass (foreground and background)look around the sharp apple.  It also makes the model''s lips stand out of the backgorund, which adds to the "eating the poisonous apple" idea.', '2004-09-01 09:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(887546, 100699, 15204, '<td valign="top">The towel as grass really kills any realism that you might have been trying to suggest.  I like the composition, though, especially the cow in the foreground.</td>', 'The towel as grass really kills any realism that you might have been trying to suggest.  I like the composition, though, especially the cow in the foreground.', '2004-09-01 09:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(887635, 100808, 13381, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept, and gorgeous colors, but the picture loses something with the out-of-focus sillhouette and the grain.</td>', 'Very cool concept, and gorgeous colors, but the picture loses something with the out-of-focus sillhouette and the grain.', '2004-09-01 10:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(887640, 101408, 13381, '<td valign="top">I very much like the composition of this shot, and certainly, the soft focus makes it look more painterly and whimsical, but it''s hard to tell in spots what is meant to be soft focus and what is motion blur.  Great concept.</td>', 'I very much like the composition of this shot, and certainly, the soft focus makes it look more painterly and whimsical, but it''s hard to tell in spots what is meant to be soft focus and what is motion blur.  Great concept.', '2004-09-01 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(887646, 100684, 13381, '<td valign="top">There''s a strange separation between the toy witch and the real background. It looks as though the background has been exceptionally dodged to give it that faded-out effect.  I agree that adds some fantasy or whimsy to it, but it makes the toy witch stick out like a sore thumb. You might try burning her (in photoshop, not, like, at the stake) :) to make her look more realistic.</td>', 'There''s a strange separation between the toy witch and the real background. It looks as though the background has been exceptionally dodged to give it that faded-out effect.  I agree that adds some fantasy or whimsy to it, but it makes the toy witch stick out like a sore thumb. You might try burning her (in photoshop, not, like, at the stake) :) to make her look more realistic.', '2004-09-01 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(887654, 101323, 13381, '<td valign="top">This is beautifully sharp, and the lighting and reflection are exquisite.  I''m not sure that looking at this picture would immediately make me think, "fairy tale," but you''ve done a great job with a hard topic.  Very nice!</td>', 'This is beautifully sharp, and the lighting and reflection are exquisite.  I''m not sure that looking at this picture would immediately make me think, "fairy tale," but you''ve done a great job with a hard topic.  Very nice!', '2004-09-01 10:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(887658, 100694, 24642, '<td valign="top">Stunnig portret.  Good cropping and lighting.  Very well done.  One of the best in the challange.  -10 Congrats</td>', 'Stunnig portret.  Good cropping and lighting.  Very well done.  One of the best in the challange.  -10 Congrats', '2004-09-01 10:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(887662, 100999, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Nice props and color harmony, I like the golden crowns.  Can''t figure out the bottom border, but I won''t let that affect the voting.</td>', 'Very good.  Nice props and color harmony, I like the golden crowns.  Can''t figure out the bottom border, but I won''t let that affect the voting.', '2004-09-01 11:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
