(888102, 100207, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is really nice! I like the colors, they way you used the sequins and feathers and face paint to create a magical being. I even like the nose ring and eye-vein! Makes her an edgy fairy. One of my top picks.</td>', 'This is really nice! I like the colors, they way you used the sequins and feathers and face paint to create a magical being. I even like the nose ring and eye-vein! Makes her an edgy fairy. One of my top picks.', '2004-09-01 15:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
