(889659, 101403, 3087, '<td valign="top">One of few attempts to bring an old and well known fairy tale into modern times. Very witty using a hooded sweatshirt to replace the hooded cape of the original. Nice touch to include only a small part of the wolf and again, very witty with the sharp suit and cigarette. 8</td>', 'One of few attempts to bring an old and well known fairy tale into modern times. Very witty using a hooded sweatshirt to replace the hooded cape of the original. Nice touch to include only a small part of the wolf and again, very witty with the sharp suit and cigarette. 8', '2004-09-02 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(889661, 101296, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea, one I thought we''d see a ton of.  The bottom of the image is cool.  Above the slipper there are way too many over exposed areas that call attention to themselves.</td>', 'Great idea, one I thought we''d see a ton of.  The bottom of the image is cool.  Above the slipper there are way too many over exposed areas that call attention to themselves.', '2004-09-02 11:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
