(889674, 100855, 5822, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with this fairy tale or character but I like the composition and feeling of motion very much.  The blur, curves, diagnals and position of the doll all help to give the feeling of whirl.  I''m not crazy about the lighting, however, and feel that it could be softer and less contrasty. Also, would like to have seen some fill light on the subjects left side.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with this fairy tale or character but I like the composition and feeling of motion very much.  The blur, curves, diagnals and position of the doll all help to give the feeling of whirl.  I''m not crazy about the lighting, however, and feel that it could be softer and less contrasty. Also, would like to have seen some fill light on the subjects left side.', '2004-09-02 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(889675, 100869, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very magical portrait.  Model is perfect - nice pose and expression.  Perfect expoure.  Background works very well for the fsiryland feeling.  Border a bit much for my taste.</td>', 'A very magical portrait.  Model is perfect - nice pose and expression.  Perfect expoure.  Background works very well for the fsiryland feeling.  Border a bit much for my taste.', '2004-09-02 12:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
