(889914, 101314, 14863, '<td valign="top">Beautiful- awesme composition and the expression that cat has is awesome, what attitude. love the desat- just  awesome, SO  good- 10!</td>', 'Beautiful- awesme composition and the expression that cat has is awesome, what attitude. love the desat- just  awesome, SO  good- 10!', '2004-09-02 15:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(889915, 100813, 14863, '<td valign="top">This is really cool &amp; different- love the glow and the  twist on the tale-  awesome job- 10!</td>', 'This is really cool & different- love the glow and the  twist on the tale-  awesome job- 10!', '2004-09-02 15:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(889916, 101293, 14863, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Love the blur of the forest- gives such a eery feeling- this  is  perfect- it''ll win for sure- great job!  10 10 10 10 10!</td>', 'Beautiful! Love the blur of the forest- gives such a eery feeling- this  is  perfect- it''ll win for sure- great job!  10 10 10 10 10!', '2004-09-02 15:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(889944, 101287, 10858, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the tale, but your photo tells me one, let me tell you it. :-)<br/> <br/>First of all, I love the duality of the photo. The armour has strength and it''s hard, she is the one who is ready to fight and die for her homeland. But under her heavy armour, she is a woman with full of sensuality (being nude under the armour makes me feel this). Maybe her family was killed and she is having revenge, but deep in her heart she has true love for a man. That''s the story your photo tells me, and therefore I love it a much! Technical presentation is great, too, lighting, composition and B&amp;W works well. Good luck! :-)</td>', 'I don''t know the tale, but your photo tells me one, let me tell you it. :-) First of all, I love the duality of the photo. The armour has strength and it''s hard, she is the one who is ready to fight and die for her homeland. But under her heavy armour, she is a woman with full of sensuality (being nude under the armour makes me feel this). Maybe her family was killed and she is having revenge, but deep in her heart she has true love for a man. That''s the story your photo tells me, and therefore I love it a much! Technical presentation is great, too, lighting, composition and B&W works well. Good luck! :-)', '2004-09-02 15:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(889946, 101296, 10858, '<td valign="top">DOF is excellent, I love the castle-shaped background which adds much to your shot. Composition with the shoe is great, nice angle. :-) Good luck!</td>', 'DOF is excellent, I love the castle-shaped background which adds much to your shot. Composition with the shoe is great, nice angle. :-) Good luck!', '2004-09-02 16:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(889951, 101384, 10858, '<td valign="top">Selective desaturation is a great technique to highlight parts of the photo. Here, though, I am not sure about it. The reds are so beautiful vivid, I am sure they would have worked well on a coloured photo. As all other colours were taken away, the dog''s toundge and a bit of the girl''s face remained redish. Anyway, composition is great, and I love the expression on her face! :-)</td>', 'Selective desaturation is a great technique to highlight parts of the photo. Here, though, I am not sure about it. The reds are so beautiful vivid, I am sure they would have worked well on a coloured photo. As all other colours were taken away, the dog''s toundge and a bit of the girl''s face remained redish. Anyway, composition is great, and I love the expression on her face! :-)', '2004-09-02 16:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(889953, 100591, 10858, '<td valign="top">Uh, ugly kind of insect.......<br/>I don''t see the connection to any fairy tale, sorry. The use of the flash was distracting, too, especially on the glass but it didn''t do much good to the skin tones, either.</td>', 'Uh, ugly kind of insect.......I don''t see the connection to any fairy tale, sorry. The use of the flash was distracting, too, especially on the glass but it didn''t do much good to the skin tones, either.', '2004-09-02 16:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(889957, 101410, 10858, '<td valign="top">Hey, the best of all frog photos! :-) He has wonderful eyes and the crown fits him well. :-) The flower adds a nice element to your greens and has a beautiful shape, but I am not sure about the position. I can''t explain why. Alltogether a great shot, and I love it. :-)</td>', 'Hey, the best of all frog photos! :-) He has wonderful eyes and the crown fits him well. :-) The flower adds a nice element to your greens and has a beautiful shape, but I am not sure about the position. I can''t explain why. Alltogether a great shot, and I love it. :-)', '2004-09-02 16:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(889962, 101289, 10858, '<td valign="top">Somehow I feel like I have seen this Lady before. Is she Pia? :-)) <br/> <br/>The photo is full of emotions: I see fear and curiosity in her eyes. The costume is great, too, and the lighting is excellent! The lantern adds a soft glare on her face. My alltogether impact is that this could be a scene from a movie, just like the pause button pressed on my DVD player. Very well done, excellent job!</td>', 'Somehow I feel like I have seen this Lady before. Is she Pia? :-))  The photo is full of emotions: I see fear and curiosity in her eyes. The costume is great, too, and the lighting is excellent! The lantern adds a soft glare on her face. My alltogether impact is that this could be a scene from a movie, just like the pause button pressed on my DVD player. Very well done, excellent job!', '2004-09-02 16:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(889966, 100715, 10858, '<td valign="top">I really hoped someone will take a chance on this tale. :-) Your photo is so nice, though I would mention a few issues. The kitty is a bit overexposed, I would have tried a softer, diffused lighting. And if only I could see her/his eyes! Maybe her/his attention on the sword would be more effective if the photo wasn''t overexposed.</td>', 'I really hoped someone will take a chance on this tale. :-) Your photo is so nice, though I would mention a few issues. The kitty is a bit overexposed, I would have tried a softer, diffused lighting. And if only I could see her/his eyes! Maybe her/his attention on the sword would be more effective if the photo wasn''t overexposed.', '2004-09-02 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(890019, 101308, 10858, '<td valign="top">And where is the hair? :-))))<br/>Nice idea, the perspective is strange, though.</td>', 'And where is the hair? :-))))Nice idea, the perspective is strange, though.', '2004-09-02 17:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(890021, 101269, 10858, '<td valign="top">Where is Jack? And the bean? :-))) Nice composition, but it''s quite unsharp.</td>', 'Where is Jack? And the bean? :-))) Nice composition, but it''s quite unsharp.', '2004-09-02 17:06:51.000000', NULL, 1);
