(890259, 101274, 20941, '<td valign="top">What a great photo! Expressions are priceless. B/W gives this a nostolgic look foe "baby boomers" like myself. Interesting take on the challenge hope you do well.</td>', 'What a great photo! Expressions are priceless. B/W gives this a nostolgic look foe "baby boomers" like myself. Interesting take on the challenge hope you do well.', '2004-09-02 20:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
