(890467, 101287, 1031, '<td valign="top">You know a good armorer ... I never made a piece of mail more than a few inches square.</td>', 'You know a good armorer ... I never made a piece of mail more than a few inches square.', '2004-09-03 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(890471, 101288, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting too ...</td>', 'Nice backlighting too ...', '2004-09-03 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(890579, 100993, 1031, '<td valign="top">Robin would recognize your killer arrows, but probably wonder what the heck that other contraption might be ... I guess English yew longbows are a bit hard to come by these days.</td>', 'Robin would recognize your killer arrows, but probably wonder what the heck that other contraption might be ... I guess English yew longbows are a bit hard to come by these days.', '2004-09-03 01:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(890581, 101296, 1031, '<td valign="top">Seems like it would make more sense (but not look as good) if the shoe faced the other way ... seems to me she lost it running away from the castle ... nice idea and execution regardless.</td>', 'Seems like it would make more sense (but not look as good) if the shoe faced the other way ... seems to me she lost it running away from the castle ... nice idea and execution regardless.', '2004-09-03 01:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(890584, 101403, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have darkened the scene more to heighten the sinister effect.</td>', 'I think I''d have darkened the scene more to heighten the sinister effect.', '2004-09-03 01:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(890586, 101384, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a stunning photo in a beautifully unique style. Looks like another ribbon!</td>', 'This is such a stunning photo in a beautifully unique style. Looks like another ribbon!', '2004-09-03 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(890593, 101325, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great setup and composition and a really nice use of that softening effect. Since the central light doesn''t seem to be coming from anywhere, you might want to tone down that effect a bit or alter it in some way. But overall, this is a really excellent photo - one of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'Great setup and composition and a really nice use of that softening effect. Since the central light doesn''t seem to be coming from anywhere, you might want to tone down that effect a bit or alter it in some way. But overall, this is a really excellent photo - one of the best of the challenge.', '2004-09-03 01:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(890595, 101396, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is funny and certain to irritate the true believers. I like it and I give my 7 for creativity totally outside the confines of the challenge. lol</td>', 'This is funny and certain to irritate the true believers. I like it and I give my 7 for creativity totally outside the confines of the challenge. lol', '2004-09-03 01:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(890597, 101033, 1031, '<td valign="top">The title is pretty in French : )<br/> <br/>This is pretty bright, and for me "hides" the subject a bit (I have some troubles with reds anyway). I think I''d have made the forest dark and gloomy ... but maybe this was early in her journey.</td>', 'The title is pretty in French : ) This is pretty bright, and for me "hides" the subject a bit (I have some troubles with reds anyway). I think I''d have made the forest dark and gloomy ... but maybe this was early in her journey.', '2004-09-03 01:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(890600, 100856, 1031, '<td valign="top">That bow looks like it''s made for right-handers only, must have been a pain ...</td>', 'That bow looks like it''s made for right-handers only, must have been a pain ...', '2004-09-03 01:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(890603, 101033, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with excellent softening effects and nice dark colors. The burned parts seem a little high in contrast, so they stand out maybe a bit too uch, but that''s a very smalll nitpick. This is a really great shot and very nice computer work.</td>', 'Beautiful photo with excellent softening effects and nice dark colors. The burned parts seem a little high in contrast, so they stand out maybe a bit too uch, but that''s a very smalll nitpick. This is a really great shot and very nice computer work.', '2004-09-03 01:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(890605, 101293, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really cool, creepy dark photo and a nice job softening the finished result. This ended up looking more like a painting than a photo, but a really nice painting. :-) Gret job!</td>', 'Really cool, creepy dark photo and a nice job softening the finished result. This ended up looking more like a painting than a photo, but a really nice painting. :-) Gret job!', '2004-09-03 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(890745, 101411, 19959, '<td valign="top">This is really excellent. I expect it will do very well.</td>', 'This is really excellent. I expect it will do very well.', '2004-09-03 05:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(890757, 101408, 5395, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... Gives a sense of being in a fantasy forest</td>', 'Beautiful... Gives a sense of being in a fantasy forest', '2004-09-03 05:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(890822, 100856, 24486, '<td valign="top">My first thought when I opened the thumbnail was its all in the way you hold your tongue. Great DOF. Incidently, I would not reccommend standing in front of an archer to get a good photograph especially the way he is holding that string back.</td>', 'My first thought when I opened the thumbnail was its all in the way you hold your tongue. Great DOF. Incidently, I would not reccommend standing in front of an archer to get a good photograph especially the way he is holding that string back.', '2004-09-03 08:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(890824, 101396, 24486, '<td valign="top">I like your take on the challenge. The shadow is a bit distracting and takes away the sharpness of the beans.</td>', 'I like your take on the challenge. The shadow is a bit distracting and takes away the sharpness of the beans.', '2004-09-03 08:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(890828, 100993, 24486, '<td valign="top">Excellant use of cropping to highlight the balance and symmetry. Good choice to go B&amp;W.</td>', 'Excellant use of cropping to highlight the balance and symmetry. Good choice to go B&W.', '2004-09-03 09:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(890829, 101267, 18028, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot, you''ve got me believing that he''s actualy running away...and those eyes!</td>', 'I really love this shot, you''ve got me believing that he''s actualy running away...and those eyes!', '2004-09-03 09:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(890830, 101325, 18028, '<td valign="top">beauty.</td>', 'beauty.', '2004-09-03 09:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(890831, 101403, 18028, '<td valign="top">awsome idea and treatment..but technicaly the lighting could have been a little better</td>', 'awsome idea and treatment..but technicaly the lighting could have been a little better', '2004-09-03 09:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(890835, 101405, 24486, '<td valign="top">Nice one. My only criticism (&amp; its a minor one) is the candle on the right is blocking part of the frame holding it, that the left candle isn''t. Otherwise a perfectly balanced photograph. The effect in the mirror glass is very fitting to your composition.</td>', 'Nice one. My only criticism (& its a minor one) is the candle on the right is blocking part of the frame holding it, that the left candle isn''t. Otherwise a perfectly balanced photograph. The effect in the mirror glass is very fitting to your composition.', '2004-09-03 09:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(890845, 100813, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a well staged shot. Very nicely done. Lighting is a little harsh though.</td>', 'This is a well staged shot. Very nicely done. Lighting is a little harsh though.', '2004-09-03 09:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(890951, 101030, 18667, '<td valign="top">I love the way the content is presented here along with the DOF.  Works well!</td>', 'I love the way the content is presented here along with the DOF.  Works well!', '2004-09-03 11:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(890961, 101207, 18667, '<td valign="top">I like the image quite well, just not the focus of the image.  Just a touch sharper without being perfectly in focus would have worked much better (in my own opinion of course)</td>', 'I like the image quite well, just not the focus of the image.  Just a touch sharper without being perfectly in focus would have worked much better (in my own opinion of course)', '2004-09-03 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
