(893278, 100855, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can see how the blur and the extreme contrast on the face could be appealing to many viewers. Unfortunately, I find them jarring. I''m not familiar with the fairy tale or folk tale you''re referring to, but that''s undoubtedly my problem and not a reason to downrate the photo.</td>', 'I can see how the blur and the extreme contrast on the face could be appealing to many viewers. Unfortunately, I find them jarring. I''m not familiar with the fairy tale or folk tale you''re referring to, but that''s undoubtedly my problem and not a reason to downrate the photo.', '2004-09-04 23:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
