(893296, 101027, 12733, '<td valign="top">The low angle emphasizes the massive Buddha. I''ll give you the appropriateness to the challenge, but it''s borderline - more a religious figure than a fairytale.</td>', 'The low angle emphasizes the massive Buddha. I''ll give you the appropriateness to the challenge, but it''s borderline - more a religious figure than a fairytale.', '2004-09-04 23:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(893299, 100999, 12733, '<td valign="top">Even a peasant girl could feel a pea that big. Very cute photo.</td>', 'Even a peasant girl could feel a pea that big. Very cute photo.', '2004-09-04 23:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(893301, 100858, 12733, '<td valign="top">How did you find a troll? I thought they all disappeared because of our lack of belief. Seriously, though, this is a great shot - mysterious lighting, tangled undergrowth and the air of mystery that every good fairy tale needs.</td>', 'How did you find a troll? I thought they all disappeared because of our lack of belief. Seriously, though, this is a great shot - mysterious lighting, tangled undergrowth and the air of mystery that every good fairy tale needs.', '2004-09-04 23:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893305, 101340, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very clever concept, and well shot. The large overexposed expanse of water takes away a bit, but it''s still a good photo.</td>', 'Very clever concept, and well shot. The large overexposed expanse of water takes away a bit, but it''s still a good photo.', '2004-09-04 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(893308, 101267, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done. The blurry grass and hands brings the viewer right to the gingerbread man, who looks both determined to get away and very yummy.</td>', 'Very cleverly done. The blurry grass and hands brings the viewer right to the gingerbread man, who looks both determined to get away and very yummy.', '2004-09-04 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
