(893347, 101353, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant scenery. The relationship to the theme is a bit thin, but acceptable.</td>', 'Brilliant scenery. The relationship to the theme is a bit thin, but acceptable.', '2004-09-04 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(893351, 100997, 12733, '<td valign="top">This shot is a scene right out of a fairy tale. It looks kind of over processed for my taste, but if that''s what it takes to create this effect, so be it.</td>', 'This shot is a scene right out of a fairy tale. It looks kind of over processed for my taste, but if that''s what it takes to create this effect, so be it.', '2004-09-04 23:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(893353, 100824, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, but does it need all that rather grubby looking foreground? I think a tighter crop would have made it a much stronger composition.</td>', 'Cute shot, but does it need all that rather grubby looking foreground? I think a tighter crop would have made it a much stronger composition.', '2004-09-04 23:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(893356, 101405, 12733, '<td valign="top">A truly ghostly effect.</td>', 'A truly ghostly effect.', '2004-09-04 23:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(893358, 101206, 12733, '<td valign="top">A cute and yummy-looking gingerbread man, but I find the composition kind of busy and the rusty-looking metal bar a distraction.</td>', 'A cute and yummy-looking gingerbread man, but I find the composition kind of busy and the rusty-looking metal bar a distraction.', '2004-09-04 23:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(893360, 101325, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and a pose that fits the title. Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and a pose that fits the title. Nice shot.', '2004-09-04 23:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(893362, 100691, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Made me actually stop and really look...10</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Made me actually stop and really look...10', '2004-09-04 23:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(893363, 100699, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute composition and a humorous take on the challenge. The out-of-focus cow is distracting - she could be closer to the action or you could have increased the DOF (if the light was sufficient).</td>', 'Very cute composition and a humorous take on the challenge. The out-of-focus cow is distracting - she could be closer to the action or you could have increased the DOF (if the light was sufficient).', '2004-09-04 23:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893368, 100989, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait, and the costuming and hair gives it the old-fashioned look that goes with the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice portrait, and the costuming and hair gives it the old-fashioned look that goes with the challenge.', '2004-09-05 00:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(893370, 100856, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors and lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors and lighting.', '2004-09-05 00:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(893411, 101412, 17304, '<td valign="top">The concept here is great and nails the challenge..however there is a tremendous amount of detail missing in both the swan and the ugly duckling.</td>', 'The concept here is great and nails the challenge..however there is a tremendous amount of detail missing in both the swan and the ugly duckling.', '2004-09-05 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(893418, 101329, 17304, '<td valign="top">took me a while to figure out how you did this without it being two photographs. Did you have her in the shot from the start or add her later? The ghosting is a little too much for the bright colors she is wearing. Also may have worked better if she appeared to be moving through the scene instead of standing still. None the less great technique and good job.</td>', 'took me a while to figure out how you did this without it being two photographs. Did you have her in the shot from the start or add her later? The ghosting is a little too much for the bright colors she is wearing. Also may have worked better if she appeared to be moving through the scene instead of standing still. None the less great technique and good job.', '2004-09-05 00:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(893420, 101272, 17304, '<td valign="top">picture is very yellow, which bothers me....was this on purpose?</td>', 'picture is very yellow, which bothers me....was this on purpose?', '2004-09-05 00:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(893423, 100989, 17304, '<td valign="top">great portrait...doesn''t seem to reflect the challenge very well though</td>', 'great portrait...doesn''t seem to reflect the challenge very well though', '2004-09-05 00:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(893424, 101388, 17304, '<td valign="top">doesn''t seem to suit the challenge very well</td>', 'doesn''t seem to suit the challenge very well', '2004-09-05 00:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(893429, 100389, 17304, '<td valign="top">LOL...great concept..lost a bit of detail in the goose and it seems slightly blurry..especially at the eye where it is most crucial...the golden egg does not appear tack sharp either so asks the question which one is the focus? But shows creativity...nicely done.</td>', 'LOL...great concept..lost a bit of detail in the goose and it seems slightly blurry..especially at the eye where it is most crucial...the golden egg does not appear tack sharp either so asks the question which one is the focus? But shows creativity...nicely done.', '2004-09-05 00:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(893435, 101411, 17304, '<td valign="top">oh my gosh...i love it!!!! i''m sure this photo will serve as an inspiration in my own work.</td>', 'oh my gosh...i love it!!!! i''m sure this photo will serve as an inspiration in my own work.', '2004-09-05 00:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(893441, 100882, 17304, '<td valign="top">it sems that metal is the hardest thing to get the lighting correct for. little too much reflection on the helmet and thigh. You may have been able to adjust the angle slightly and thus bringing out the detail in the silver armor but then again this may have been one of those situations you got the best angle you could. Great photo.</td>', 'it sems that metal is the hardest thing to get the lighting correct for. little too much reflection on the helmet and thigh. You may have been able to adjust the angle slightly and thus bringing out the detail in the silver armor but then again this may have been one of those situations you got the best angle you could. Great photo.', '2004-09-05 00:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(893446, 100884, 17304, '<td valign="top">LOL...doesnt'' really suit the challenge that well in my opinion, yet I love it....where can i get me one of those??</td>', 'LOL...doesnt'' really suit the challenge that well in my opinion, yet I love it....where can i get me one of those??', '2004-09-05 00:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(893451, 100694, 17304, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait...not sure where it fits into the fairy tails though. The hair across her nose is slightly distrating as is the bright colors to the right...</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait...not sure where it fits into the fairy tails though. The hair across her nose is slightly distrating as is the bright colors to the right...', '2004-09-05 00:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(893456, 101296, 17304, '<td valign="top">Is she running away from the castle or to it?</td>', 'Is she running away from the castle or to it?', '2004-09-05 00:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893464, 100207, 17304, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! Should prove to be an inspiration! Two comments though. The nost has a little too much shine and the far eye is showing a little too much white. Did you paint the model or adjust colors in photoshop?</td>', 'Excellent photo! Should prove to be an inspiration! Two comments though. The nost has a little too much shine and the far eye is showing a little too much white. Did you paint the model or adjust colors in photoshop?', '2004-09-05 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(893467, 101287, 17304, '<td valign="top">beautiful photograph</td>', 'beautiful photograph', '2004-09-05 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(893533, 100694, 16301, '<td valign="top">The light and colors here are great. (9)<br/> <br/>Good luck...</td>', 'The light and colors here are great. (9) Good luck...', '2004-09-05 01:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(893683, 101021, 22125, '<td valign="top">Love the crown</td>', 'Love the crown', '2004-09-05 05:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(893708, 100859, 3280, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, one of my two favorites.  Background and colors are perfect and focus clarity is spot on.  I like the grain on the floor as well.  Great shot!</td>', 'Excellent shot, one of my two favorites.  Background and colors are perfect and focus clarity is spot on.  I like the grain on the floor as well.  Great shot!', '2004-09-05 08:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(893709, 101351, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and color.  The only nit I have is that the first coin on the bottom either has no markings or is reflecting the light.  Very innovative and well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting and color.  The only nit I have is that the first coin on the bottom either has no markings or is reflecting the light.  Very innovative and well done.', '2004-09-05 08:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(893710, 101313, 3280, '<td valign="top">The nicest of the sword shots.  Very well done.</td>', 'The nicest of the sword shots.  Very well done.', '2004-09-05 08:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(893712, 100882, 3280, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Great focus and choice of background. Feels like we are back in the days.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Great focus and choice of background. Feels like we are back in the days.', '2004-09-05 08:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(893713, 101412, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  I wonder what it looked like in Color.  Good eye for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture.  I wonder what it looked like in Color.  Good eye for the challenge.', '2004-09-05 08:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(893714, 101347, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very good set up.  I like the focus on the apple and Snow White in the background.  Excellent capture.</td>', 'Very good set up.  I like the focus on the apple and Snow White in the background.  Excellent capture.', '2004-09-05 08:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(893719, 101325, 21711, '<td valign="top">i think this is a really cool shot. i like it alot. i hope she didnt sit on any poison ivy ^_^</td>', 'i think this is a really cool shot. i like it alot. i hope she didnt sit on any poison ivy ^_^', '2004-09-05 08:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(893720, 100207, 21711, '<td valign="top">pretty cool shot, i like it.</td>', 'pretty cool shot, i like it.', '2004-09-05 08:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(893722, 101293, 21711, '<td valign="top">i like the feeling of this. its a great shot.</td>', 'i like the feeling of this. its a great shot.', '2004-09-05 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(893725, 101325, 16230, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but the burning is way too obvious. Real shadow and light could have made this really good.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but the burning is way too obvious. Real shadow and light could have made this really good.', '2004-09-05 08:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(893731, 100207, 16230, '<td valign="top">You did a great job of capturing a secretive, mischievous look. This should do very well. Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'You did a great job of capturing a secretive, mischievous look. This should do very well. Congrats! ', '2004-09-05 09:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(893732, 100997, 16230, '<td valign="top">I love it! Good composition, and great use of color. Very close to what I see in my mind''s eye when I think of Merlin. This should get a ribbon. Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love it! Good composition, and great use of color. Very close to what I see in my mind''s eye when I think of Merlin. This should get a ribbon. Congrats! ', '2004-09-05 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(893733, 101411, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The look on his face and the smoke makes this work. Where did you come up with those clothes? This should get a ribbon. Congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nice! The look on his face and the smoke makes this work. Where did you come up with those clothes? This should get a ribbon. Congrats! ', '2004-09-05 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893749, 101384, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The selective desaturation is very effective on this image, and the composition is exceptional.  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  The selective desaturation is very effective on this image, and the composition is exceptional.  10', '2004-09-05 09:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(893750, 100207, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love how you''ve filled the frame, and the colours are fantastic. 10</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love how you''ve filled the frame, and the colours are fantastic. 10', '2004-09-05 09:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(893752, 101410, 16790, '<td valign="top">Stunning all around - the clarity, the composition, the colours... everything.  Well done - 10</td>', 'Stunning all around - the clarity, the composition, the colours... everything.  Well done - 10', '2004-09-05 09:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(893754, 100996, 16790, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colours of this, and the perfect simplicity.  This one doesn''t even need a title - it''s all in the photo. 10</td>', 'I love the vibrant colours of this, and the perfect simplicity.  This one doesn''t even need a title - it''s all in the photo. 10', '2004-09-05 09:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(893756, 100989, 16790, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  The composition is very pleasing, and the pale colours give this a very soft, feminine feel.  Lovely work. 10</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  The composition is very pleasing, and the pale colours give this a very soft, feminine feel.  Lovely work. 10', '2004-09-05 09:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(893757, 100686, 16790, '<td valign="top">Once again... gorgeous.  This is going in my favourites.</td>', 'Once again... gorgeous.  This is going in my favourites.', '2004-09-05 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(893758, 101293, 16790, '<td valign="top">The dreamlike feel of this is absolutely fantastic, and the colours are perfectly saturated for this kind of shot.  Beautiful, beautiful work.  10</td>', 'The dreamlike feel of this is absolutely fantastic, and the colours are perfectly saturated for this kind of shot.  Beautiful, beautiful work.  10', '2004-09-05 09:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(893759, 100691, 16790, '<td valign="top">This one needs no title to be completely effective; the composition and clarity are both flawless, and the idea is both creative and well executed.  The colouring is perfect for conveying a sense of magic.  Exquisite work, this is going in my favourites. 10</td>', 'This one needs no title to be completely effective; the composition and clarity are both flawless, and the idea is both creative and well executed.  The colouring is perfect for conveying a sense of magic.  Exquisite work, this is going in my favourites. 10', '2004-09-05 09:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(893762, 100813, 16790, '<td valign="top">This is quite the modern take on Sleeping Beauty!  I love the colours of this, and the wonderful contrast between the whites surrounding her and the blacks surrounding him.  The cool tones in the background give this a nice atmosphere and compliment the blue hair; I''m glad you chose a relatively light background in favour of a dark one, which would have swallowed him up.  Very nice work :)</td>', 'This is quite the modern take on Sleeping Beauty!  I love the colours of this, and the wonderful contrast between the whites surrounding her and the blacks surrounding him.  The cool tones in the background give this a nice atmosphere and compliment the blue hair; I''m glad you chose a relatively light background in favour of a dark one, which would have swallowed him up.  Very nice work :)', '2004-09-05 09:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(893763, 100699, 16790, '<td valign="top">How adorable!  I love the concept of this, and the execution is brilliant.  DOF is great, and the picture is clear enough to stand alone even without the title.  Very creative, and very well done.</td>', 'How adorable!  I love the concept of this, and the execution is brilliant.  DOF is great, and the picture is clear enough to stand alone even without the title.  Very creative, and very well done.', '2004-09-05 09:57:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(893764, 101206, 9576, '<td valign="top">This is just great 10</td>', 'This is just great 10', '2004-09-05 09:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(893792, 101410, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, lol :)</td>', 'Fantastic, lol :)', '2004-09-05 11:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(893863, 100884, 20496, '<td valign="top">This one really stands out from the others.   Not a fairy tale in the literal sense, but definetely as fantastic and way out there as the prince charmings of old.</td>', 'This one really stands out from the others.   Not a fairy tale in the literal sense, but definetely as fantastic and way out there as the prince charmings of old.', '2004-09-05 12:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(893953, 101411, 23338, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this slightly higher, but the bar across the bottom bothered me.  When I crop it out, the overall picture looks more concise or uniform.  With it, I''m drawn to it and wonder about the relationship between the "mist" and the bar.</td>', 'I would have rated this slightly higher, but the bar across the bottom bothered me.  When I crop it out, the overall picture looks more concise or uniform.  With it, I''m drawn to it and wonder about the relationship between the "mist" and the bar.', '2004-09-05 14:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(893959, 101293, 23338, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feeling and composition of this image, but without the title,  the figure could be just about anything: a sprite, Hansel running from the woods, a one-legged crow :-), etc.  Just the same, its a nice image: mysterious, dark, foreboding, slightly out of focus so you worry about what is out there - and you run from it toward the light.</td>', 'I like the overall feeling and composition of this image, but without the title,  the figure could be just about anything: a sprite, Hansel running from the woods, a one-legged crow :-), etc.  Just the same, its a nice image: mysterious, dark, foreboding, slightly out of focus so you worry about what is out there - and you run from it toward the light.', '2004-09-05 14:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(893962, 101410, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ok.  I normally go, "What?  Another FROG?"  But, I had to laugh.  What in the world was this frog thinking with that little crown balanced on its head?  The focus, composition and coloring were all really great.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Ok.  I normally go, "What?  Another FROG?"  But, I had to laugh.  What in the world was this frog thinking with that little crown balanced on its head?  The focus, composition and coloring were all really great.  Nice photo.', '2004-09-05 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(893964, 100999, 23338, '<td valign="top">Ultimately, I rated this as high as anything else I rated during this challenge: the young lady really DOES look tired, the overall image has a nice, balanced quality to it.   Everything is in focus, and the trappings are all very princess-like.  And, it''s obvious what the subject is.  Not a bad photo for the challenge.</td>', 'Ultimately, I rated this as high as anything else I rated during this challenge: the young lady really DOES look tired, the overall image has a nice, balanced quality to it.   Everything is in focus, and the trappings are all very princess-like.  And, it''s obvious what the subject is.  Not a bad photo for the challenge.', '2004-09-05 14:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(893971, 100808, 23338, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to "capture" a fairy, or "prove the existence" of one of those little elusive creatures, it probably won''t be a direct sighting anyway - why NOT a shadow?   Tht''s better than some little fake model that is so obviously placed in a contrived setting.  Besides, I liked the theme and presentation.   Different.   Congratulations.</td>', 'If you''re going to "capture" a fairy, or "prove the existence" of one of those little elusive creatures, it probably won''t be a direct sighting anyway - why NOT a shadow?   Tht''s better than some little fake model that is so obviously placed in a contrived setting.  Besides, I liked the theme and presentation.   Different.   Congratulations.', '2004-09-05 14:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(893973, 100691, 23338, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and attractive effect.</td>', 'Very interesting and attractive effect.', '2004-09-05 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(893978, 100503, 23338, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the title, but I liked the idea behind the image.  It just seems a little cluttered toward the top where the out of focus, lite-colored red and white object is in the background.   The plants, the brighter focused area in the middle bleeding out to dark around the edges - all seems to work pretty well, except for those couple of background items.  Cute image.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the title, but I liked the idea behind the image.  It just seems a little cluttered toward the top where the out of focus, lite-colored red and white object is in the background.   The plants, the brighter focused area in the middle bleeding out to dark around the edges - all seems to work pretty well, except for those couple of background items.  Cute image.', '2004-09-05 15:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(893981, 101269, 23338, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m just not into cute word plays.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m just not into cute word plays.', '2004-09-05 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(893982, 100991, 23338, '<td valign="top">Just not my image of Cinderella - and I thought she made it into the ball ...</td>', 'Just not my image of Cinderella - and I thought she made it into the ball ...', '2004-09-05 15:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(893983, 101396, 23338, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I''m just not into word plays.</td>', 'Sorry, I''m just not into word plays.', '2004-09-05 15:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(893984, 101288, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! Great submission for the challenge.</td>', 'Very nicely done! Great submission for the challenge.', '2004-09-05 15:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(893985, 101308, 23338, '<td valign="top">As a pure photo, I would have gotten a little more in at the top, rather than cutting it off.    And, if there were a young lady with long hair up on one of the turrets, or in a window - then you wouldn''t even need the title to explain what was going on.  Interesting architecture though.</td>', 'As a pure photo, I would have gotten a little more in at the top, rather than cutting it off.    And, if there were a young lady with long hair up on one of the turrets, or in a window - then you wouldn''t even need the title to explain what was going on.  Interesting architecture though.', '2004-09-05 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(893988, 100859, 4871, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazing detail! I think the framing is slightly left of where it should be - or a crop may have worked better.</td>', 'Wow! Amazing detail! I think the framing is slightly left of where it should be - or a crop may have worked better.', '2004-09-05 15:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(893989, 100870, 4871, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I think it could have been better executed&gt; I don''t like the background - if it were set on a wooden background or something I would have rated it higher - something that adds to your subject.</td>', 'Great idea, but I think it could have been better executed> I don''t like the background - if it were set on a wooden background or something I would have rated it higher - something that adds to your subject.', '2004-09-05 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(893992, 100207, 4871, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! This looks as if a lot of thought has gone into it and may have taken some time to execute?</td>', 'Very nicely done! This looks as if a lot of thought has gone into it and may have taken some time to execute?', '2004-09-05 15:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(893993, 101412, 4871, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but not ''fairytaley'' enough if you know what I mean. Also your would have had a more powerful composition if you had cropped it on the LHS.</td>', 'Great idea, but not ''fairytaley'' enough if you know what I mean. Also your would have had a more powerful composition if you had cropped it on the LHS.', '2004-09-05 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(893994, 101325, 4871, '<td valign="top">I really like the balance of this phograph and the softness that has been added. Beautiful subject and nicely composed. Well done!</td>', 'I really like the balance of this phograph and the softness that has been added. Beautiful subject and nicely composed. Well done!', '2004-09-05 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(893997, 101286, 4871, '<td valign="top">What can I say - a beautiful image that has been perfectly composed!</td>', 'What can I say - a beautiful image that has been perfectly composed!', '2004-09-05 15:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(893998, 100699, 4871, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph! Very amusing :) I like the detail that has been retained in your image.</td>', 'Awesome photograph! Very amusing :) I like the detail that has been retained in your image.', '2004-09-05 15:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(894001, 101395, 4871, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand why you have chosen this focus - it may well have been a great shot if your subject was in focus.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand why you have chosen this focus - it may well have been a great shot if your subject was in focus.', '2004-09-05 15:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(894003, 101027, 4871, '<td valign="top">Awesome cloud formations, but I wouldn''t have thought Bhudda to be an entry for fairytales! You may find that people could be offended by this :P</td>', 'Awesome cloud formations, but I wouldn''t have thought Bhudda to be an entry for fairytales! You may find that people could be offended by this :P', '2004-09-05 15:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
