(894013, 101048, 25464, '<td valign="top">Good Idea.  I think it could have used a bigger frog.  I like the pose and the composition otherwise.</td>', 'Good Idea.  I think it could have used a bigger frog.  I like the pose and the composition otherwise.', '2004-09-05 15:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
