(894030, 101384, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea, and a nice photo.  I think maybe I would have liked it better without the selective desaturation.  Actually, now that I look again, I think the desat would be fine, but I would rather have seen just the little girl and not the dog.  Her expression is so perfect, that should have been the focal point and the dog is distracting from it.  She has great eyes.  I hope to see more work with her in it.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea, and a nice photo.  I think maybe I would have liked it better without the selective desaturation.  Actually, now that I look again, I think the desat would be fine, but I would rather have seen just the little girl and not the dog.  Her expression is so perfect, that should have been the focal point and the dog is distracting from it.  She has great eyes.  I hope to see more work with her in it.', '2004-09-05 15:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
