(895201, 101347, 24642, '<td valign="top">This one should have ranked higher.  A good clean and simple idea.</td>', 'This one should have ranked higher.  A good clean and simple idea.', '2004-09-06 07:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(895205, 101033, 22967, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your 15th place finish; I really liked this one. The woods seem a bit "busy" to me and may have been imporoved if it were a bit darker.</td>', 'Congrats on your 15th place finish; I really liked this one. The woods seem a bit "busy" to me and may have been imporoved if it were a bit darker.', '2004-09-06 07:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(895215, 100686, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully atmospheric...maybe just too contemporary for the "Fairy Tale" challenge, but a definite winner in a "Horror" genre or a free study.<br/> <br/>Gordon</td>', 'Beautifully atmospheric...maybe just too contemporary for the "Fairy Tale" challenge, but a definite winner in a "Horror" genre or a free study. Gordon', '2004-09-06 07:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(895222, 101287, 14603, '<td valign="top"><br/>Having a studio, props, models and lighting is one thing...making good use of them another and you certainly did that here, the way this is lit has made the picture for me.It would have been so easy to ruin it, but you have made a superb job with your attention to detail.<br/> <br/>In my opinion the only reason this is not a blue ribbon is that there may not have been enough "Fairy Tale" connection for some.<br/> <br/>Very well done.</td>', 'Having a studio, props, models and lighting is one thing...making good use of them another and you certainly did that here, the way this is lit has made the picture for me.It would have been so easy to ruin it, but you have made a superb job with your attention to detail. In my opinion the only reason this is not a blue ribbon is that there may not have been enough "Fairy Tale" connection for some. Very well done.', '2004-09-06 08:03:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(895238, 101293, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. And now that I look at it again closely I wish that I had given it a 10 instead of the 8 I gave it. It just goes to show you that you should really spend more time looking at a photo before voting, or else go back to them again.<br/>Excellent work Gordon this is a fantastic image!</td>', 'This is amazing. And now that I look at it again closely I wish that I had given it a 10 instead of the 8 I gave it. It just goes to show you that you should really spend more time looking at a photo before voting, or else go back to them again.Excellent work Gordon this is a fantastic image!', '2004-09-06 08:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(895269, 101325, 21083, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue ! Very well deserved !</td>', 'Congrats on the blue ! Very well deserved !', '2004-09-06 09:01:38.000000', NULL, 0),
