(895282, 101410, 24065, '<td valign="top">I''m not a full member yet -- trying to get a few more open challenges under my belt before I do that, but if I had been able to vote this would have been my favorite one.  And thanks for all the info about how you did the photo -- that helps those of us who are new to photography and also assures those of us who are animal-lovers!</td>', 'I''m not a full member yet -- trying to get a few more open challenges under my belt before I do that, but if I had been able to vote this would have been my favorite one.  And thanks for all the info about how you did the photo -- that helps those of us who are new to photography and also assures those of us who are animal-lovers!', '2004-09-06 09:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(895334, 101286, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by graphicfunk:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your 10th placing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, Mr. Cuesta.  That means a lot coming from you as I hold your work in very high regard.  I was very hopeful on this photo as I spent a lot of time composing it and getting it "right."<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by graphicfunk: Congratulations on your 10th placing.   Thank you, Mr. Cuesta.  That means a lot coming from you as I hold your work in very high regard.  I was very hopeful on this photo as I spent a lot of time composing it and getting it "right." ', '2004-09-06 10:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
