(896168, 101293, 8860, '<td valign="top">I knew this was yours Gordon - was going to come back to it but had little time to vote or comment recently. <br/> <br/>Great stuff (if a little too overprocessed for my taste). You have a wonderful appreciation of light and its effects, coupled with a sensitive approach to the processing. Your original has a touch more charm in my view since you left your challenge shot open to the presumption of extensive filter treatments. This does of course only matter if winning is the desired outcome!</td>', 'I knew this was yours Gordon - was going to come back to it but had little time to vote or comment recently.  Great stuff (if a little too overprocessed for my taste). You have a wonderful appreciation of light and its effects, coupled with a sensitive approach to the processing. Your original has a touch more charm in my view since you left your challenge shot open to the presumption of extensive filter treatments. This does of course only matter if winning is the desired outcome!', '2004-09-06 18:40:24.000000', NULL, 0),
