(897796, 101286, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Sonifo:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice setup.   I love the red color here.  The cropping is good too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you.  I appreciate the comment very much.  I really like rich colors and I think I showed that here.  ;)<br/> <br/>I do prefer black and white and almost changed it but I saw the colors and changed my mind.</td>', 'Originally posted by Sonifo: Very nice setup.   I love the red color here.  The cropping is good too.   Thank you.  I appreciate the comment very much.  I really like rich colors and I think I showed that here.  ;) I do prefer black and white and almost changed it but I saw the colors and changed my mind.', '2004-09-07 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(897878, 100207, 21862, '<td valign="top">instead of double-sided tape, I''ve found using paper cement useful when tacking faux jewels onto the face.  Just be sure to let the solvent evaporate before adhering to prevent irritation.</td>', 'instead of double-sided tape, I''ve found using paper cement useful when tacking faux jewels onto the face.  Just be sure to let the solvent evaporate before adhering to prevent irritation.', '2004-09-07 19:55:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(898298, 100207, 7252, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ericlimon:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TechnoShroom:</b></div><hr/><i> .... and I am. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>???? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You would have to read my original comment on the image.</td>', 'Originally posted by ericlimon: Originally posted by TechnoShroom: .... and I am.  ????   You would have to read my original comment on the image.', '2004-09-07 23:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
