(913888, 101355, 24896, '<td valign="top">Zero comments...thats not right...I didn''t vote on this challenge but thought you might like some feedback anyway. Mid-day light was probably the downfall for this pic and soft or lack of focus hardly ever goes over well on this site. The location isn''t that bad and with a little creative composition I think it could have done a lot better. Your title made me laugh...my interpretation was "talking/cursed outhouse" but thats just the way I am. Hope this helps.</td>', 'Zero comments...thats not right...I didn''t vote on this challenge but thought you might like some feedback anyway. Mid-day light was probably the downfall for this pic and soft or lack of focus hardly ever goes over well on this site. The location isn''t that bad and with a little creative composition I think it could have done a lot better. Your title made me laugh...my interpretation was "talking/cursed outhouse" but thats just the way I am. Hope this helps.', '2004-09-16 23:48:44.000000', NULL, 0),
